1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,121
这根形似小香肠的盲管，就是阑尾。
This small sausage-shaped tube is the | appendix.

2
00:00:04,571 --> 00:00:07,951
发起炎来，它可能染上红、黄、黑。
When inflamed, it may turn red, yellow, | then black.

3
00:00:08,401 --> 00:00:12,328
每一次颜色流转，都记录着组织的伤痕。
These colors reveal how tissue is injured.

4
00:00:12,778 --> 00:00:16,451
循着这抹色彩，我们走进炎症的现场。
Follow the colors to understand | inflammation.

5
00:00:16,901 --> 00:00:20,867
病理学里的“变质”，不是食物变坏。
In pathology, alteration has a specific | meaning.

6
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:24,113
先听听身体发出的求救信号。
Start with the body's warning signs.

7
00:00:24,563 --> 00:00:28,749
疼痛可能从肚脐周围，移向右下腹。
Pain may move from around the navel to the | lower right abdomen.

8
00:00:29,199 --> 00:00:33,380
还可能恶心、发热，右下腹明显压痛。
Nausea, fever, and marked lower right | abdominal tenderness may occur.

9
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:37,842
疼痛若持续加重，别抱着侥幸硬扛。
Do not ignore persistent or worsening | pain.

10
00:00:38,292 --> 00:00:42,614
相似的求救声，也可能来自其他腹部疾病。
Other abdominal conditions can cause | similar symptoms.

11
00:00:43,064 --> 00:00:45,937
有些人的信号，却并不典型。
Some people have atypical symptoms.

12
00:00:46,387 --> 00:00:49,687
医生先循着症状和体格检查寻找线索，
Doctors begin with symptoms and physical | examination,

13
00:00:50,137 --> 00:00:53,451
再参考化验，判断是否阑尾炎。
then use laboratory results to help assess | appendicitis.

14
00:00:53,901 --> 00:00:56,507
CT是重要的辅助确诊工具，
CT is an important diagnostic aid.

15
00:00:56,957 --> 00:00:59,336
但并非人人都必须做CT。
But not everyone needs a CT scan.

16
00:00:59,786 --> 00:01:02,477
汇总8项研究的荟萃分析显示，
A meta-analysis pooling 8 studies found:

17
00:01:02,927 --> 00:01:09,007
增强螺旋CT敏感度95%、特异度94%。[1]
For contrast-enhanced helical CT, | sensitivity: 95%; specificity: 94%.

18
00:01:09,457 --> 00:01:12,739
这束影像之光，能帮助发现病变，
It can help detect appendicitis.

19
00:01:13,189 --> 00:01:17,125
却仍需结合临床，判断病情轻重。
Severity still requires an overall | assessment.

20
00:01:17,925 --> 00:01:22,764
单纯性→化脓性（蜂窝织炎性）→坏疽性
Simple → suppurative (phlegmonous) → | gangrenous

21
00:01:23,014 --> 00:01:25,702
是最常见的典型演变，
is the most common typical progression,

22
00:01:25,952 --> 00:01:29,837
但并不是每个患者都必经的固定流程。
but not every patient follows this fixed | sequence.

23
00:01:30,637 --> 00:01:36,172
第一幕红：单纯性阑尾炎，充血、轻度肿胀。
Act I, red: simple appendicitis, | with congestion and mild swelling.

24
00:01:36,622 --> 00:01:40,772
局部血管扩张，血流增多，染出这抹红。
Dilated vessels and increased blood flow | cause redness.

25
00:01:41,222 --> 00:01:43,656
血管里的液体和蛋白质渗出，
Fluid and proteins leak out of blood | vessels,

26
00:01:44,106 --> 00:01:47,331
积在组织间隙，形成水肿。
causing tissue edema and swelling.

27
00:01:47,781 --> 00:01:51,997
巡逻的白细胞游出血管，挺进受损组织。
Patrolling white blood cells leave vessels | and advance into injured tissue.

28
00:01:52,447 --> 00:01:56,165
这是身体为抵御损伤，调动的防御。
Inflammation is the body's protective | response to injury.

29
00:01:56,615 --> 00:02:00,712
然而战况一旦失控，也可能伤及自身组织。
An excessive response can also damage the | body's own tissue.

30
00:02:01,162 --> 00:02:05,557
液体、蛋白质和白细胞外出，叫渗出。
These changes are called exudation.

31
00:02:06,007 --> 00:02:10,094
单纯性时，中性粒细胞主要驻守在
In simple appendicitis, neutrophils are | mainly found

32
00:02:10,544 --> 00:02:14,936
黏膜及黏膜下层，组织损伤相对较轻。
in the mucosa and submucosa, with | relatively mild damage.

33
00:02:15,386 --> 00:02:18,301
变质，就是细胞组织的变性、坏死。
Alteration means cell degeneration and | necrosis.

34
00:02:18,751 --> 00:02:21,816
此时，黏膜上皮已局部受损脱落。[2]
Mucosal epithelium is locally injured | and shed.

35
00:02:22,266 --> 00:02:25,015
CT可见管径增粗、壁增厚，
CT may show a wider appendix and a | thickened wall,

36
00:02:25,465 --> 00:02:29,543
周围脂肪轻度模糊，呼应早期的炎症。
with mild surrounding fat stranding, | matching early inflammation.

37
00:02:30,343 --> 00:02:34,948
第二幕黄：炎症的战线累及整层阑尾壁。
Act II, yellow: inflammation involves | the full appendiceal wall.

38
00:02:35,398 --> 00:02:39,668
这是化脓性，也叫蜂窝织炎性阑尾炎。
Suppurative (phlegmonous) appendicitis.

39
00:02:40,118 --> 00:02:43,405
中性粒细胞纷纷涌入，部分变性坏死。
Many neutrophils enter; some degenerate | and die.

40
00:02:43,855 --> 00:02:47,824
脓液中，还混着组织碎屑与渗出的液体。
Pus also contains tissue debris and exuded | fluid.

41
00:02:48,274 --> 00:02:52,714
渗出愈明显，局部肿胀往往愈突出。
More pronounced exudation often means | greater swelling.

42
00:02:53,164 --> 00:02:57,458
变性坏死的中性粒细胞，就是脓细胞。
These degenerated, necrotic neutrophils | are pus cells.

43
00:02:57,908 --> 00:03:02,285
渗出的纤维蛋白原凝成纤维素网。
Exuded fibrinogen forms a fibrin mesh.

44
00:03:02,735 --> 00:03:07,770
网与脓细胞等交织，形成纤维脓性渗出物。
The mesh mixes with pus cells and debris | to form fibrinopurulent exudate.

45
00:03:08,220 --> 00:03:12,648
黄色并非只来自纤维素，更来自大量脓细胞。
Yellow comes not only from fibrin, | but also from many pus cells.

46
00:03:13,098 --> 00:03:18,420
浆膜面可见纤维素性脓性渗出（含脓细胞）。
Fibrinopurulent exudate with pus cells | coats the serosa.

47
00:03:18,870 --> 00:03:22,764
CT常见壁增厚强化、周围渗出明显，
CT: thickened, enhancing wall; marked | surrounding exudation.

48
00:03:23,214 --> 00:03:26,314
与管壁内外的炎症相互映照。
matching inflammation in and around the | appendix.

49
00:03:27,114 --> 00:03:31,703
终局黑：腔内压力升高，危机步步逼近。
Final act, black: pressure inside rises.

50
00:03:32,153 --> 00:03:36,624
血管受压或形成血栓，阑尾壁陷入缺血。
Vessel compression or clots cause ischemia | of the appendiceal wall.

51
00:03:37,074 --> 00:03:41,307
血流受阻，组织坏死，还伴有出血。
Tissue dies, often with bleeding.

52
00:03:41,757 --> 00:03:44,995
坏死与血红蛋白分解产物，
Necrosis and hemoglobin breakdown products

53
00:03:45,445 --> 00:03:48,111
让局部暗红，甚至发黑。
can make the tissue dark red or black.

54
00:03:48,561 --> 00:03:53,361
变质在这里走向重处：大片组织坏死。
Alteration becomes severe: | extensive tissue necrosis.

55
00:03:53,811 --> 00:03:57,690
它与渗出，共同写下急性期的病变。
Alteration and exudation together mark | the acute phase.

56
00:03:58,140 --> 00:04:00,569
这便是坏疽性阑尾炎。
This is gangrenous appendicitis.

57
00:04:01,019 --> 00:04:05,745
脆弱的管壁可能穿孔，让感染扩散至腹腔。
The wall may perforate, spreading | infection into the abdomen.

58
00:04:06,195 --> 00:04:10,515
CT若见壁强化缺损，要警惕坏死；
A wall enhancement defect on CT raises | concern for necrosis.

59
00:04:10,965 --> 00:04:15,427
若见腔外气体、脓肿，更要警惕穿孔。[3]
Extraluminal gas or an abscess raises | concern for perforation.

60
00:04:16,227 --> 00:04:19,759
读懂分型，是为了把握治疗的紧迫性。
Classification helps determine treatment | urgency.

61
00:04:20,209 --> 00:04:24,344
最终分型，仍靠切除后的病理切片确认。
The final type is confirmed by pathology | after removal.

62
00:04:24,794 --> 00:04:28,700
CT也帮助发现坏疽、穿孔、脓肿等并发症。[3][4]
CT also helps detect gangrene, | perforation, and abscesses.

63
00:04:29,150 --> 00:04:32,804
蜂窝织炎性、坏疽性需手术切除。[5]
Suppurative (phlegmonous) and gangrenous | types require appendectomy.

64
00:04:33,254 --> 00:04:36,326
面对病变，治疗要结合患者的具体情况。
Treatment depends on the patient's | individual condition.

65
00:04:36,776 --> 00:04:40,278
是否马上手术，由医生评估决定。
Doctors assess how urgently surgery is | needed.

66
00:04:41,078 --> 00:04:44,192
反复发作，可转为慢性阑尾炎。
Repeated episodes may lead to chronic | appendicitis.

67
00:04:44,642 --> 00:04:47,249
急性期以变质、渗出为主，
The acute phase mainly involves | alteration and exudation;

68
00:04:47,499 --> 00:04:49,486
转为慢性才出现增生。
proliferation appears in the | chronic phase.

69
00:04:49,936 --> 00:04:54,300
镜下可见阑尾壁纤维组织增生、纤维化，
Microscopy shows fibrous tissue growth | and fibrosis in the appendiceal wall,

70
00:04:54,750 --> 00:04:58,110
伴淋巴细胞、浆细胞等慢性炎细胞浸润。[2]
with chronic inflammatory cells such as | lymphocytes and plasma cells.

71
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:01,837
转入慢性，并不意味着从此风平浪静。
Chronic disease still carries risks.

72
00:05:02,287 --> 00:05:06,798
疼痛即便时轻时重，也应接受正规评估。
Even intermittent pain deserves proper | medical assessment.

73
00:05:07,248 --> 00:05:10,736
一旦确诊，通常建议症状缓解期择期切除；
Once diagnosed, elective appendectomy is | usually advised when symptoms settle;

74
00:05:10,986 --> 00:05:15,322
若正处急性发作期，则视情况急诊手术。
during an acute episode, emergency surgery | depends on the situation.

75
00:05:15,772 --> 00:05:18,908
红、黄、黑，是洞察微观病变的罗盘，
Red, yellow, and black are a compass | for understanding microscopic changes,

76
00:05:19,358 --> 00:05:23,432
不是等待病情演进的时钟。别等病情加重，
not a clock to wait by. | Do not wait for disease to worsen.

77
00:05:23,882 --> 00:05:27,831
持续右下腹痛、发热，请及时就诊。
Seek medical care for persistent lower | right abdominal pain or fever.
